lting toward a flip.\n\nPrediction markets give Peltola roughly a 73% chance, and Republicans have grown visibly anxious, prompting Trump to travel to Alaska to rally for Sullivan and to warn voters about the second Dan Sullivan on the ballot. Sullivan retains the advantages of incumbency and a favorable partisan baseline, keeping this competitive, but the weight of recent evidence points narrowly toward Peltola.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5747, "margin": 0.87}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6955, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6995, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6965, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.6035, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.5728, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6289, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6364, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6246, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.603, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6381, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6392, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6364, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6469, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6459, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6429, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6784, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6123, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.6534, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6296, "margin": 2.2}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.7064, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.6746, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.6676, "margin": 2.4}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.6581, "margin": 3.0}]}